{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "id/bipa6.u10",
  "language": "id",
  "unit": "bipa6.u10",
  "version": 2,
  "content_hash": "44e0e31cb0f64bf1ed205e69b3e9efd17ce3361c001e5f5a543ecf1b836559e9",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u10.l01",
      "sha256": "1613a924a6a1715be28ff25e6d782e593320ec561dfe7f0214c097daf41ce750"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u10.l02",
      "sha256": "9f7a5fbfb7f391a262d93d9c146ea534b24a1711924dc29edfc9f6294eb42027"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u10.l03",
      "sha256": "97251df8ebf3533de326e90b3088f03a9ea334b9a7f4b6deb36dd739284dca0f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u10.l04",
      "sha256": "85d6847127effd4c54f008bc70ef6e71658b12945db07c03357417de26b65cc2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u10.l05",
      "sha256": "23c45f4a4215050765677af8a47f8a5f284a3f5bba928c25cf78a65013aad2ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u10.l06",
      "sha256": "469a12b101169357c27bf9f88a22339541214bcebb764c3d6b38ec70c0561d43"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "02d4b2ff986c68868da8544358cd8b4dcb51bd15fdcb636d90ad4caa84c771dd",
      "text": "Mohamed mengutip Sitepu untuk mendukung tesisnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "055c2cd80bd1223c6785a1de6d126aa59a8f50aa7e797c8a207bda5636ac8809",
      "text": "Terima kasih. Penguji bilang jawaban saya meyakinkan.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a61b310ed95faba62929a26791afb16627ad2d0c5e9b714e55a9931093b0e5b",
      "text": "menyatakan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "14d74686a71e6171fbaebf66b62ff873889a0abf47dc599db11fea9f07ac5a26",
      "text": "di samping itu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 14,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1636755363ecd18544c9d96cb83f905aaf82267b3dbeeac5685dd5e90d53ce15",
      "text": "Namun, dalam wawancara saya, warga yang terlibat merasa lebih cepat beradaptasi.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 80,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "189719a6508f3537bd4075b78df3e396d9bb6d1dbbdaa0abd6c448526f718fb7",
      "text": "Lihat, Sinabung kelihatan jelas pagi ini. Selamat, esaimu lulus!",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1b62722d1f24da29823e0d721c40a1a052cb1efbed793270456b2ffe5a5e94f7",
      "text": "Jadi, BIPA 6 selesai. Ke mana sesudah ini?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 42,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "21f1d2797f95c07ad84664c9b6659852268550970c734789b127ef6bd6949400",
      "text": "kalimat penjelas",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 16,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "252eb9afa30b68a8c96ef13d9ce5cfe05b383f8414a2458e7be251ef49883c37",
      "text": "Di samping itu, kalimat penjelas memberikan contoh dan data.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2a5680aece063736b1cd5cf07df5da26578418efd582e425eb364296e7601278",
      "text": "Kalau begitu, pakai tanda petik. Atau buat parafrasa dengan kata-katamu sendiri.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 80,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2cf952bffb1e3ecd84ac9d9fc5092a49a99f4d6f2f824b4264b1a97f5f351e4e",
      "text": "meyakinkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2d2a5866efd23a406c7087e3a1161ba707bbf7b4f838414367efa9ad6bcc9aaa",
      "text": "Kampus memakai aplikasi untuk memeriksa plagiarisme.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2fbaea50fdb78984b15ef38311c96963844ea47d9dc8d8b35ee8ab4a6c6e7dbf",
      "text": "Ia mengutip sebuah rujukan yang belum terbit.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "38254c49200bee08c77845f38e7176de1c2026ac0f5d1167063128de20304f0d",
      "text": "Daftar pustaka disusun menurut abjad.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 37,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3840f828d70e3f24077e990d7c6d503b7e1c559cb7183a3935712e6608680d05",
      "text": "Ia menegaskan bahwa parafrasa tetap memerlukan sumber.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "39434f2c7c7d5122216170fe3e4e326d3ebd29ccd1b4508e0111cbabd7d2d412",
      "text": "Penguji meminta Mohamed menanggapi kelemahan datanya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3986401d4028202b1accbaa525d1cddac9350b2a077cae5cebc789f349224969",
      "text": "Singkatnya, letusan itu merugikan petani, tetapi tanahnya kini lebih subur.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3c4b507c15263b58e07aa58ac3790f98dff244aa87fa7ff817781bb338018a8a",
      "text": "Kutipan langsung harus ditulis di antara tanda petik.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3d77482bbf8c0c1d0819134a810a5b157a63ab907986d478339996eec4b410c0",
      "text": "kutipan langsung",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 16,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3d9d598cc51d52698d987beffa9bc0afa8f47cbb13b9df9f8facf4eb21dc712c",
      "text": "Baik, Pak. Saya akan menulisnya sendiri supaya tetap orisinal.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "424d5f8337d337867e9fedeabba7462fdf2759aad0571b05eeeec58f01fd847d",
      "text": "Warga desa mengungkapkan harapan mereka untuk pulang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "42ba5ed0c6fd4a39df0ec771690f3662efb7641c2a6d34c43726e47cfed61cc9",
      "text": "Tesismu menarik. Tapi apakah warga benar-benar ingin terlibat?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4e4469b74f04f6131159a61ed276336bc60cbedca0b6914ec788ccefcd37439a",
      "text": "Jawaban yang meyakinkan. Silakan lanjut.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 40,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "550d924275798b2438006dfeef060f507c8ecd3f42f5d989dee774e4f5e97f3d",
      "text": "Kamu mengutip Sitepu, tapi namanya tidak ada di daftar pustaka.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5a4f21e19f771ed8cd1c22d2fd4b6d7a964ad1e58c7fb37f9a89ef41d7a26b83",
      "text": "Siap. Untuk kata baku, rujukan saya KBBI saja.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5c139913828d1ef63d03d336513c0c5416dc174b0282214579e3fbc1a39dc240",
      "text": "Singkatnya, kalimat utama memuat gagasan pokok paragraf.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5ef9cba548e967f5c30e9734e33e9d91590221a5314dc6ae8cd4a92f9e34e635",
      "text": "daftar pustaka",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 14,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6039741211555476457aa80e59a752c42bebea112ec3814f2ea29f9783ac232b",
      "text": "tesis",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6549b08b80dda674669520fc3e5c30227c92a69c22129146d76af7577a620a24",
      "text": "orisinal",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "693d20bcd839620d703917c89fa171a9d23e751c8d6ce593c86f189a73abed15",
      "text": "Menurut data tahun lalu, lebih dari dua ribu keluarga sudah pindah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6aef6ec301dba7bd257be2f346c6ff2e46209208441e46f1afb07d24fc4e2199",
      "text": "lebih lanjut",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7545542437fb196b01ded54582b35c2ab966aec04499e3d5fb27ee850ec7091b",
      "text": "mengutip",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "75af8c07c4245c7673eef79e93f0ff36359bc2bb24061a68956ccd4c3e90098f",
      "text": "Ke timur, jauh sekali. Raja Ampat, Papua!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 41,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7fa43a3b6e31be8023928e9c8798499c17dd1fcdd241431780c9db57729ee920",
      "text": "data",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "84e64401e91663cec03e06e7b630f906f51fdca21d3af31585da0efcf24f713d",
      "text": "Esai ini orisinal, dan semua sumbernya ada di daftar pustaka.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "88b6ce43b628f04912cb7babde8779b84c2fc83f1fdbfc663000bd8e12d66d59",
      "text": "Argumen yang meyakinkan tidak menyembunyikan kelemahannya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8d2a771620335e921a7325c998fe8a883de2b44b9ade16b5414f1677f1c356cc",
      "text": "menegaskan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8df45bbe330dd8844f87697c142154c3d8f0f882d5a2b04c8b6700d4630341ca",
      "text": "Penulis mengungkapkan harapannya, dan datanya cukup meyakinkan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8f9c77cdbb1d33018df5f32a57f6d644cf4c48dff074a84ee821f1c161f57e54",
      "text": "penguji",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "927bce7e3f4821849084837805aa435ace54dd9ef9ec97d7e64b82145e5dde40",
      "text": "Penguji kedua menanggapi esai itu dengan pertanyaan yang tajam.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "94f0515b33b67e60eb09a98fc4ea2d2c8948d9b36e1a8877c61e092b71d5f1e0",
      "text": "halaman",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9597cb24e62bda9330a8522f82afab756d892d05af2cb54cd3bdf1283c1da29f",
      "text": "Buku ini terbit pertama kali pada tahun dua ribu dua puluh satu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "999b9ceeef79613c673ac380dfc782f2c4b18d9a9834507ab247eab79cc1526b",
      "text": "Bagaimana kalau \"Relokasi warga Sinabung perlu melibatkan warga sendiri\"?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9ba02f9c05a760dd99e639b9ddb9583bc9b866a3158624f8269e89f9123106fd",
      "text": "Aduh, lupa. Bukunya terbit tahun berapa, ya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a09ab5e71c1949e2ba2593dfd257a80d31606e701eb8a753200a515237403945",
      "text": "Tanpa data, tesis yang orisinal pun sulit dipercaya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a2339c1401c5513ba980dbafb33f4cd353747856622dc96b5411e7e9777a6c67",
      "text": "plagiarisme",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a61232d676f33d4780287120dcd8439bc18c4ba42cbbe4f34fd0536930ebf3a6",
      "text": "mengungkapkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a67265e86244e64247ba1af4704dba42ca022730e92331a6605ee6585c5635d5",
      "text": "Saya ingin menanggapi pertanyaan Bapak dengan data terbaru.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a768607d095ad4bfd87d1c7133723af6961e929b29dfffeaf0b5dfe5cc623db6",
      "text": "Baik. \"Sitepu menyatakan bahwa abu gunung api akhirnya menyuburkan tanah.\"",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 74,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a9b49f0f86fef103cc11bce055afe9a931301f1177e40078fe7053a30d87d65e",
      "text": "Kalau mengutip, tulis nama penulis, tahun, dan halaman.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ab00c60f39d4c77664e1291278ecced06ec7c13c6754b6c8b400737ee41363c3",
      "text": "Singkatnya, setiap rujukan harus ada di daftar pustaka.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "acae68c5b38e7586f43abc283e5c441b671e2dabb1120f29a4458ed46d14508e",
      "text": "Jauh lebih baik. Sekarang cari data untuk mendukungnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b49b4cec22755a50cc3894cdaa1dc24dbb229ab937d6658fb8c6caae20a4b814",
      "text": "menanggapi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b5407dc1999240943c57997fe2a5d89f186174589bb5701e339aba2f0767a80e",
      "text": "Hmm, tidak ada. Kalimat utamanya tentang tanah yang subur.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ba66cd43cf4f6ae6bb25f62e2542ab8cd5693d1b02893167912a99c5acdd807d",
      "text": "Maaf, Pak. Saya kira itu kutipan langsung.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 42,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ba967c656ff6557f1daa852313fee0aabbc8c8e4793875c077a0707aa1dffc53",
      "text": "Ketiga penguji sepakat bahwa jawaban Mohamed sangat meyakinkan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bfe134f2a3cda0a06a26c62f8da1789b8b1e96156f9108a5a96694df2d080e73",
      "text": "Mohamed, paragraf ini sama persis dengan artikel Sitepu.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c08c0f6651c57201d112aa94b1c708774fd659e49979bb14ab2e818fcd1d5ad9",
      "text": "rujukan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c992b26e1d09920aee4ed331173517fe0a5e07cf22ade976010bd6f87b7727c3",
      "text": "terbit",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cb3b184b6cd4db818da163aab7d383f6771d7d77f17564185d525cc8d5509cf3",
      "text": "Terima kasih, Bu. Memang, data saya hanya dari dua desa. Itu kelemahannya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 74,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cd5a0853dfaa0b1ccb5ce1eff6eabb040b566c2adaeacc2a34652ae4aea6f765",
      "text": "kalimat utama",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cd6973d027293ce1816035cb92256ffd6d6fea891a3ccd9fc38a57fe66d443cc",
      "text": "Lebih lanjut, penelitian ini menunjukkan bahwa hasil panen meningkat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d226331e806f67938b7b26063b53a9227d546eafc96bc85d8ae03024fa9edc92",
      "text": "Peneliti itu menegaskan bahwa desa di zona merah tidak boleh dihuni lagi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d7a29b5001b9df57895897308a3e7f15ef86fcadf383698376f20c1a1ff418a0",
      "text": "parafrasa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e9ae2c56b3258b0af70e2426fcb4defca9bf7d032f7376b5de6311a1daae40aa",
      "text": "Tesismu \"Gunung berapi itu berbahaya.\" Terlalu luas, Mohamed.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ec3219bac6c02de519aa4c0197eb49a63192b3b7613f3a7bf037162190ddd523",
      "text": "Dan saya tutup dengan \"Singkatnya, …\". Terima kasih, Rani!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "eecdf0660c357604293f8b22af5d34dbd9f843a5609db08299125db4c33f2c76",
      "text": "singkatnya",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f1b808f7252fe9673206477105730f2ab150f4ece4be3700830aed21fd48e69c",
      "text": "Tahun 2021. Dan jangan lupa nomor halamannya di dalam teks.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f672894313129c30541c05b64e4c8ecf49241b6691415222fe055b21d3c125f8",
      "text": "Jadi buang saja. Lalu tambahkan \"Di samping itu\" sebelum data curah hujan.",
